{"id":8568376721587,"title":"Vintage Turkish Runner Rug, 2.7x9.8 ft, 82x300 cm","handle":"vintage-turkish-runner-rug-2-7x9-8-ft-82x300-cm","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"457\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eThis vintage Turkish runner rug features a warm faded palette and a charming geometric tribal design. The rug has a soft earthy brown field decorated with repeated stepped medallion motifs, checker-style details, and small symbolic patterns. Its border is finished with colorful triangular accents, giving the piece a lively Anatolian character.\u003cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"762\"\u003eThe color palette includes faded brown, terracotta, soft coral, muted orange, ivory, gray, dusty pink, mustard yellow, and subtle blue accents. Its aged surface and handwoven texture create a relaxed vintage look that works beautifully in bohemian, rustic, eclectic, farmhouse, or traditional interiors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003eMeasuring \u003cstrong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"800\"\u003e82x300 cm \/ 2.7x9.8 ft\u003c\/strong\u003e, this runner is ideal for a hallway, entryway, kitchen, corridor, bedroom side, or long narrow decorative space. Its elongated format makes it practical for high-traffic areas while adding warmth, history, and handmade charm.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1261\"\u003eAs a vintage handmade rug, it may show natural signs of age such as gentle wear, fading, slight irregularities, fringe wear, and variation in pile or shape. These details are part of its originality and make each piece one of a kind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1275\"\u003eDetails:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1278\"\u003eOrigin: Turkey\u003cbr data-start=\"1292\" data-e